.TH PSModelOutputs 3 2024-03-09 "PsyC 0.9.5" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSModelOutputs\fR

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/psyc.h>

.I
PSFloat  *
.br
\fBPSModelOutputs\fR(\fIPSModel *model\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Get the output values of the output (last) layer of \fImodel\fR. The function basically calls \fIPSLayerOutputs\fR on the layer returned by \fIPSGetOutputLayer\fR.

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1), PSGetOutputLayer(3), PSLayerOutputs(3)
